---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import Architecture from '../components/Architecture.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import Process from '../components/Process.astro';
import Reviews from '../components/Reviews.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import {services,projects,url} from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="Thoughtful Home Remodeling in San Jose" description="Kitchen and bathroom remodeling, painting, flooring, and home renovations in San Jose and surrounding communities. Start your project with Ocean General Contractors." home>
<div class="brand-entrance" aria-hidden="true"><div class="entrance-line"></div><span>O C E A N</span><small>GENERAL CONTRACTORS</small></div>
<section class="hero"><Photo name="hero" alt="A contemporary home with warm timber cladding and illuminated interiors — architectural inspiration" eager sizes="(max-width: 800px) 140vh, 100vw" class="hero-photo"/><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-line"></span> THOUGHTFUL REMODELING. SAN JOSE & BEYOND.</p><h1><span class="headline-line">Built with purpose.</span><span class="headline-line"><em>Crafted to last.</em></span></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>Considered spaces. Exceptional details.<br/>A home that feels entirely yours.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href={url('/projects/')} class="button light">Explore our work <Arrow diagonal /></a><a href={url('/contact/')} class="hero-text-link">Start your project <Arrow /></a></div></div></div><div class="hero-foot"><a href="#introduction" class="scroll-cue"><span>↓</span> SCROLL TO DISCOVER</a><span>DESIGN INSPIRATION · A VISION OF HOME</span><span class="hero-coordinate">37.3387° N &nbsp; 121.8853° W</span></div></section>
<section id="introduction" class="intro section"><p class="eyebrow">A BETTER WAY TO COME HOME</p><div><h2>Good spaces don’t<br/>happen by chance.<br/><em>They’re thoughtfully built.</em></h2><div class="intro-bottom"><p>Home is where life unfolds. We bring care, clarity, and craftsmanship to the spaces that matter most—from a single room to a whole new perspective.</p><a href={url('/about/')} class="text-link">The Ocean approach <Arrow diagonal /></a></div></div></section>
<section class="services-section section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR EXPERTISE</p><h2>Every detail.<br/><em>Every possibility.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={url('/services/')}>Explore all services <Arrow diagonal /></a></div><div class="service-panels">{services.slice(0,4).map(s=><a class="service-panel" href={url(`/services/${s.slug}/`)}><Photo name={s.image} alt={`${s.short} design inspiration`} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 25vw"/><div class="service-panel-overlay"></div><span class="service-number">{s.number}</span><div class="service-panel-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFULLY TRANSFORMED</p><h3>{s.short}</h3><p>{s.description}</p><span class="service-panel-link">Explore service <Arrow diagonal /></span></div></a>)}</div><p class="image-caption">A few possibilities for your home. Service imagery is architectural inspiration.</p></section>
<section class="philosophy section"><div class="philosophy-copy"><p class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOU</p><h2>From the first line.<br/>To the <em>finishing touch.</em></h2><p>Behind every beautiful space is a plan with purpose. We listen to how you live, consider what your home could be, and bring the details together with care.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('/about/')}>Meet Ocean <Arrow diagonal /></a></div><Architecture /></section>
<section class="featured-projects section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SPACES, RECONSIDERED</p><h2>A closer look<br/><em>at our work.</em></h2></div><div><p>Real spaces. Thoughtful changes.<br/>Explore documented company projects.</p><a href={url('/projects/')} class="text-link">View the project gallery <Arrow diagonal /></a></div></div><div class="featured-grid">{[projects[2],projects[1]].map((project,index)=><ProjectCard project={project} index={index}/>)}</div></section>
<Process /><Reviews /><CTA />
</Layout>
